A woman is here.
She says: "Good day."
"My name is Mette."
"What is your name?"
I say: "Hi. My name is Maya."
Mette says: "Where do you come from, Maya?"
"I come from Mexico."
"And you?"
"I come from Denmark," says Mette.
"Welcome to Copenhagen."
Mette is my new neighbour.
She is friendly, and I am happy.
